Starting kafka:
   in archive/software/kafka start:
       ./start_kafka
       ./start_kafka_connect

Trade service:
    services/ao/trade_service.py

Market script is:
    services/ao/ao_market_service.py - to start the market service for ao.

The API script is: trade_api.py, single threaded can be spawned as:
   python3 services/ao/trade_api.py

Deploying trade_api.py in multithreading:
gunicorn -w 8 trade_api:application 

(application is the flask application to be launched).
Gunnicorn launches on a different port. 


Start the controller in the rt_server folder.
